  aciklama:
  - "Yollad\u0131\u011F\u0131n g\xF6rsellerin bir b\xF6lgesi, ilk bak\u0131\u015Fta
    bana bir eyeri an\u0131msatt\u0131. Son y\u0131llarda aran\u0131z\u0131n limoni
    oldu\u011Fu bir yak\u0131n\u0131n var gibi g\xF6z\xFCk\xFCyor. \xD6yle ki; \"eski
    dosttan d\xFC\u015Fman olmaz\" s\xF6z\xFC, bu ki\u015Fi i\xE7in art\u0131k ge\xE7erli
    de\u011Fil gibi. Sana kar\u015F\u0131 bir tav\u0131r ald\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131,
    senin aleyhine baz\u0131 i\u015F ya da s\xF6ylemlerin i\xE7erisinde oldu\u011Funu
    hissediyorum. Bu eyer, o ki\u015Fiye kar\u015F\u0131 ba\u015Fka bir insandan
    yard\u0131m alaca\u011F\u0131na ve korunaca\u011F\u0131na i\u015Faret {{isim}}.
    Ayn\u0131 fincan foto\u011Fraf\u0131n\u0131 \"Y\" ekseninde \xE7evirdi\u011Fimde
    ise, bu defa \xFCzerinde {{sabit_harf}} harfi olan bir \"kuartz\" ta\u015F\u0131
    g\xF6r\xFCyorum. Ad\u0131n\u0131n ba\u015F harfi {{sabit_harf}} olan bu ki\u015Finin
    sana duydu\u011Fu \xF6zlem g\xFCn ge\xE7tik\xE7e art\u0131yor g\xF6z\xFCk\xFCyor."
